{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Yonder comes a rabbit, how do I [G]know?
Fur is shinin’ [D]in the sun, / Shinin’ bright like [A]gold, gold; shinin’ bright like [D]gold.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Big-eyed rabbit’s [A]gone, boys, big-eyed rabbit’s [D]gone; Big-eyed rabbit’s [A]gone, boys, big-eyed rabbit’s [D]gone.
